@startuml GraphRAG_DataFlow

!theme cerulean
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam ActivityDiamondFontSize 10

skinparam rectangle {
    BorderColor #4A6FA5
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}

skinparam arrow {
    Color #4A6FA5
    FontColor #555555
    FontSize 10
}

title <size:18><b>GraphRAG Code Reviewer — PR Review Data Flow</b></size>\n<size:12><color:#666666>From GitHub Webhook to AI-Generated Review Comment</color></size>

|#E8F0FE| **GitHub** |
start
:Developer opens / updates\na **Pull Request**;
:GitHub sends **Webhook Event**\n(HMAC SHA-256 signed);

|#F5F0FF| **Webhook Service** |
:Verify webhook\nsignature (crypto);
:Fetch PR diff via\nGitHub REST API;
:Enqueue to **review-queue**\n(BullMQ → Redis);

|#FFF8E7| **Message Queue** |
:Job picked up by\n**Review Worker**\n(concurrency: 2);

|#F0FFF0| **RAG Service** |

partition "**Phase 1: Diff Analysis**" #E5F5E5 {
    :Parse diff using\n**parse-diff** library;
    :Extract changed **file paths**\nand **line ranges**\n(old-file coordinates);
}

partition "**Phase 2: Impact Detection**" #E5F5E5 {
    :Query **Neon PostgreSQL**\nsymbols table;
    note right
        **Overlap Formula:**
        SymbolStart ≤ RangeEnd
        AND
        SymbolEnd ≥ RangeStart
    end note
    :Find **directly affected symbols**\n(functions, classes, methods);
    :Traverse **dependency graph**\nvia edges table;
    note right
        Follow outgoing
        "calls" edges to find
        downstream dependents
    end note
    :Build **expanded impact set**\n(base + downstream symbols);
}

partition "**Phase 3: Context Retrieval**" #E5F5E5 {
    :Query **Pinecone** vector DB\nfor impacted symbol code;
    :Retrieve **source code snippets**\nwith metadata\n(path, type, line range);
}

partition "**Phase 4: LLM Review Generation**" #FFF0F0 {
    :Construct **structured prompt**\nSection 1: Diff\nSection 2: Impact Radius;
    :Send to **Google GenAI**\n(gemma-3-12b-it)\nTemperature: 0.1;
    note right
        Detect:
        🔴 Critical Issues
        🟡 Suggestions
        🟢 Commendations
    end note
    :Receive **Markdown review**;
}

|#F5F0FF| **Webhook Service** |
:Post review as **PR comment**\nvia GitHub API;

|#E8F0FE| **GitHub** |
:Review appears on\nthe **Pull Request**;

stop

legend bottom right
    |= Phase |= Database / Service |
    | Diff Analysis | parse-diff library |
    | Impact Detection | Neon PostgreSQL (graph) |
    | Context Retrieval | Pinecone (vectors) |
    | Review Generation | Google GenAI (LLM) |
endlegend

footer <size:10><i>GraphRAG Code Reviewer — Pull Request Review Data Flow</i></size>

@enduml
